<http://data.silknow.org/object/e9800776-d24f-3769-abf6-ba0ab6c1a77e>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Small square of off-white cotton worked in cross stitch in polychrome silk yarns. A house on a stepped base having a person on each step. In front of base are three boats with people. Above this are various birds, hearts, crowns, and a cherub. All stylized. Border: a geometric undulating leafy stalk. Edged with pink silk; ribbon attached at each corner.  Slightly soiled and stained.  Stitches: cross."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/f50aff4b-4396-32e9-9e06-66a94939a395> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Small square of off-white cotton worked in cross stitch in polychrome silk yarns. A house on a stepped base having a person on each step. In front of base are three boats with people. Above this are various birds, hearts, crowns, and a cherub. All stylized. Border: a geometric undulating leafy stalk. Edged with pink silk; ribbon attached at each corner.  Slightly soiled and stained.  Stitches: cross."@en ;
